{"title": "Tree Falls on School Bus in Mumbai, Killing 11-Year-Old Student", "summary": "A 10-year-old boy was killed when a peepal tree fell on his school bus in the Chembur area of Mumbai. The incident occurred during heavy rains and rescue operations were launched to retrieve the trapped children. The cause of the tree falling is still under investigation.", "summary_points": ["A tree fell on a school bus in Mumbai, killing an 11-year-old student.", "The incident occurred during heavy rains in the Chembur area of Mumbai.", "Rescue operations were launched to retrieve the trapped children.", "The cause of the tree falling is still under investigation.", "Four other students were injured in the incident."], "title_hi": "मुंबईः स्कूल बस पर पेड़ गिरने से 11 वर्षीय छात्र की मौत, चार घायल", "summary_hi": "मुंबई के चेंबूर इलाके में मंगलवार दोपहर एक स्कूल बस पर पेड़ गिर गया, जिससे एक 10 वर्षीय बच्चे की मौत हो गई और कई बच्चे घायल हो गए।", "summary_points_hi": ["मुंबई के चेंबूर इलाके में स्कूल बस पर पेड़ गिर गया, जिससे एक छात्र की मौत हो गई.", "इस घटना ने मंगलवार दोपहर हुई थी।", "हादसे के समय कई बच्चों को बाहर निकालने के लिए प्रयास किया गया।", "पेड़ गिरने की वजह का पता अभी तक नहीं चल सका है।", "चार अन्य छात्र घायल हुए थे।"], "framing": {"left": "Left-leaning outlets emphasize the tragic loss of life and the need for improved infrastructure to prevent such incidents. They also highlight the role of climate change in exacerbating extreme weather events.", "center": "Centrist coverage focuses on the facts of the incident, including the cause of the tree falling and the rescue efforts. However, some outlets mention the heavy rains as a contributing factor to the accident.", "right": "Right-leaning outlets frame the story around the potential for government negligence or incompetence in failing to prevent such incidents. They also emphasize the need for increased security measures."}, "framing_hi": {"left": "वामपंथी समाचार एजेंसियां इस घटना में एक दुखद निधन के साथ शुरू होती हैं